Usage: qodercli plugins uninstall|remove [options] <plugin>

Uninstall a plugin.

Arguments:
  plugin               Plugin name to uninstall.

Options:
  -s, --scope <scope>  Scope to uninstall from: "user" (global, default),
                       "project" (shared, committed to VCS), or "local"
                       (personal, not committed). (choices: "user", "project",
                       "local", default: "user")
  --keep-data          Preserve the plugin data directory. (default: false)
  --json               Output as JSON. (default: false)
  -h, --help           display help for command
